# API and data platform

Uncoil accepts telemetry through three practical paths:

- Use an SDK when you control the application code and want nested traces with minimal setup.
- Use [OpenTelemetry](/docs/integrations) when your framework already exports standard spans.
- Use the [ingestion API](/docs/api) when a custom runtime needs direct HTTP access.

All paths converge on the same project trace model. Keep authentication server-side, send stable run and span identifiers, and include the metadata needed for grouping and release comparison.
